@base = http://localhost:5010

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Register - response: 201
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"student01","email":"student01@example.test","password":"StrongPassword_123!"}

### Login - copy accessToken into bearer variable
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"student01","password":"StrongPassword_123!"}

### Get tags (authenticated)
GET {{base}}/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create task
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Finish the assignment","status":"Todo","description":"Week 10","tagIds":[1]}

### Tasks (paginated)
GET {{base}}/tasks?page=1&pageSize=10&status=Todo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin reports
GET {{base}}/reports/tasks/by-status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/reports/tasks/by-user
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/reports/tags/top?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/reports/tasks/overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
